{number: 73}
{title: Where He Leads Me}
{key: C}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[C] I can hear my Savior calling,
I can hear my Savior calling,
I can [F] hear my Savior calling,
"Take thy [C] cross and [G7] follow, follow [C] Me."
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
Where He [C] leads me I will follow,
Where He leads me I will follow,
Where He [F] leads me I will follow,
I'll go [C] with Him, [G7] with Him all the [C] way.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: 2}
I'll go [C] with Him through the garden,
I'll go with Him through the garden,
I'll go [F] with Him through the garden,
I'll go [C] with Him, [G7] with Him all the [C] way.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 3}
I'll go [C] with Him through the judgment,
I'll go with Him through the judgment,
I'll go [F] with Him through the judgment,
I'll go [C] with Him, [G7] with Him all the [C] way.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 4}
He will [C] give me grace and glory,
He will give me grace and glory,
He will [F] give me grace and glory,
And go [C] with me, [G7] with me all the [C] way.
{end_of_verse}
